---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms & Conditions"
  description="Pixel8 Multimedia terms and conditions of sale for wall art products and personalised artwork services."
>
  <section class="relative bg-bg-secondary py-16">
    <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-1 bg-pop-orange"></div>
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <nav class="flex items-center gap-2 font-dm text-sm text-gray-500 mb-6">
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-pop-orange transition-colors">Home</a>
        <span>/</span>
        <span class="text-off-white">Terms & Conditions</span>
      </nav>
      <h1 class="font-montserrat font-bold text-5xl text-off-white tracking-wide mb-4" style="text-shadow: 3px 3px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.4);">TERMS & CONDITIONS</h1>
      <p class="font-dm text-gray-400 text-sm">Last updated: September 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <div class="space-y-8 font-dm text-gray-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-montserrat font-semibold text-off-white text-lg uppercase tracking-wide mb-3">General</h2>
        <p>These terms and conditions govern your use of the Pixel8 Multimedia website (pixel8multimedia.co.uk) and the purchase of products from us. By placing an order, you agree to be bound by these terms. Pixel8 Multimedia is a trading name operated from the United Kingdom.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-montserrat font-semibold text-off-white text-lg uppercase tracking-wide mb-3">Products & Pricing</h2>
        <p>All products are made to order. Prices are displayed in GBP and include VAT where applicable. We reserve the right to change prices at any time, but changes will not affect orders already placed. All prices for UK mainland orders include free postage and packaging.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-montserrat font-semibold text-off-white text-lg uppercase tracking-wide mb-3">Orders</h2>
        <p>When you place an order, you will receive an email confirmation. This confirmation does not constitute acceptance of your order. We reserve the right to refuse or cancel any order for any reason, including but not limited to product availability, errors in pricing or product information, or issues with payment verification. If we cancel your order, you will receive a full refund.</p>
      </div>

      <div id="cancellation" class="scroll-mt-24">
        <h2 class="font-montserrat font-semibold text-off-white text-lg uppercase tracking-wide mb-3">Cancellation &amp; Returns</h2>
        <p>These rights apply to our ready-made wall art. Personalised items made from your own photo work differently — see <a href="#personalised" class="text-pixel-cyan hover:text-pop-orange transition-colors">Personalised Products</a> below.</p>

        <h3 class="font-montserrat font-semibold text-off-white text-base mt-6 mb-2">Changing your mind</h3>
        <p>Under the Consumer Contracts (Information, Cancellation and Additional Charges) Regulations 2013 you may cancel your order for any reason within <strong class="text-off-white">14 days</strong> of the day you receive it. You do not need to give a reason.</p>
        <p class="mt-3">To cancel, <a href="/contact" class="text-pixel-cyan hover:text-pop-orange transition-colors">contact us</a> before that period ends — an email is enough, and you may use the model cancellation form in the Regulations if you prefer. You then have a further 14 days to send the item back to us.</p>
        <p class="mt-3">Please return items in their original condition and packaging. You are responsible for the cost of return postage when you are simply changing your mind, and for the item until it reaches us, so we recommend a tracked service. If an item's value has been reduced because it was handled more than was necessary to check it, we may deduct that reduction from your refund.</p>
        <p class="mt-3">We refund within 14 days of receiving the item back, to the payment method you used. That includes the standard delivery charge you originally paid, though not any extra you chose to pay for faster delivery.</p>

        <h3 class="font-montserrat font-semibold text-off-white text-base mt-6 mb-2">Faulty, damaged or wrong items</h3>
        <p>If an item arrives damaged, faulty, or is not what you ordered, please <a href="/contact" class="text-pixel-cyan hover:text-pop-orange transition-colors">contact us</a> with a photograph and we will put it right. Under the Consumer Rights Act 2015 you have 30 days from delivery to reject a faulty item for a full refund, and rights to a repair, replacement or partial refund after that. We pay the return postage on faulty or incorrect items, and these rights apply to personalised items too.</p>

        <h3 class="font-montserrat font-semibold text-off-white text-base mt-6 mb-2">What cannot be cancelled</h3>
        <p>The 14-day right to change your mind does not apply to goods that are made to your specification or clearly personalised, which includes every item made from a photo you supply. Your rights over faulty goods are unaffected.</p>
      </div>

      <div id="personalised" class="scroll-mt-24">
        <h2 class="font-montserrat font-semibold text-off-white text-lg uppercase tracking-wide mb-3">Personalised Products</h2>
        <p>For personalised orders you are responsible for providing suitable photographs and accurate customisation details. We reserve the right to refuse any order containing inappropriate, offensive, or copyrighted material that we do not have the rights to reproduce.</p>

        <h3 class="font-montserrat font-semibold text-off-white text-base mt-6 mb-2">Your photo</h3>
        <p>By uploading a photo you confirm that you own it or have permission to use it, and that everyone shown in it has agreed to appear on a printed product. You keep all rights in your photo. You give us permission to process it, create your design and print your order, and nothing more. We will not use your photo or your design in our own marketing unless you tell us we can.</p>

        <h3 class="font-montserrat font-semibold text-off-white text-base mt-6 mb-2">What we cannot accept</h3>
        <p>Our image provider automatically refuses photos of well-known people, stills from films and television, and other copyrighted images. We may also refuse anything unlawful or obscene, or which we reasonably believe you do not have permission to use. If a photo is refused you are not charged, and you are welcome to try a different one.</p>

        <h3 class="font-montserrat font-semibold text-off-white text-base mt-6 mb-2">Previews and proofs</h3>
        <p>The previews you see while designing are watermarked and at screen resolution. Printed items are produced from a higher-resolution version of the same design.</p>
        <p class="mt-3">Once you have paid we email you a proof. <strong class="text-off-white">Nothing is printed until you approve it.</strong> Please check it carefully — the likeness, anything written in the photo itself, the style, the size and the format. If something is wrong, reply to that email before approving and we will put it right.</p>

        <h3 class="font-montserrat font-semibold text-off-white text-base mt-6 mb-2">Cancellation and returns</h3>
        <p>Personalised items are made specifically for you from your own photo. Under the Consumer Contracts (Information, Cancellation and Additional Charges) Regulations 2013, goods made to your specification or clearly personalised are not covered by the usual 14-day right to cancel. This is exactly why we send you a proof to approve first.</p>
        <p class="mt-3">You may cancel free of charge at any point <strong class="text-off-white">before you approve your proof</strong> — simply reply to the proof email and we will refund you in full.</p>
        <p class="mt-3">Your statutory rights are unaffected. If your item arrives damaged, faulty, or materially different from the proof you approved, contact us within 30 days and we will replace it or refund you.</p>

        <h3 class="font-montserrat font-semibold text-off-white text-base mt-6 mb-2">Colour and canvas edges</h3>
        <p>Screens and printers reproduce colour differently, and canvas and paper take ink differently. Small variation between your on-screen proof and the printed item is normal and is not a fault.</p>
        <p class="mt-3">On canvas orders the design is printed at full size on the face of the canvas, and the edges that wrap around the frame are filled with a block colour taken from your artwork. Nothing from your design is lost around the sides.</p>

        <h3 class="font-montserrat font-semibold text-off-white text-base mt-6 mb-2">Fees and availability</h3>
        <p>A £5 personalisation fee is included in the price of every personalised item and covers creating your design. It forms part of the item price and is refunded with it if you cancel before approving your proof.</p>
        <p class="mt-3">The number of styles you can try per photo is limited, and the design tool may occasionally be unavailable if we reach our daily capacity. This does not affect any order you have already placed.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-montserrat font-semibold text-off-white text-lg uppercase tracking-wide mb-3">Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>All designs, artwork, logos, and content on this website are the property of Pixel8 Multimedia or are used under licence. You may not reproduce, distribute, or use any content from this website without our written permission. When you upload photos for personalised orders, you confirm that you own the rights to those images or have permission to use them.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-montserrat font-semibold text-off-white text-lg uppercase tracking-wide mb-3">Delivery</h2>
        <p>We aim to dispatch standard orders within 3-6 working days. Personalised orders require proof approval before printing begins — please allow 3-6 working days from the date of proof approval. Delivery times are estimates and not guaranteed. We are not responsible for delays caused by postal services or couriers.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-montserrat font-semibold text-off-white text-lg uppercase tracking-wide mb-3">Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>Pixel8 Multimedia shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from your use of our website or products. Our total liability for any claim shall not exceed the amount you paid for the product in question.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-montserrat font-semibold text-off-white text-lg uppercase tracking-wide mb-3">Governing Law</h2>
        <p>These terms are governed by the laws of England and Wales. Any disputes will be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of England and Wales.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-montserrat font-semibold text-off-white text-lg uppercase tracking-wide mb-3">Contact</h2>
        <p>For any questions about these terms, please <a href="/contact" class="text-pixel-cyan hover:text-pop-orange transition-colors">contact us</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
